WEBVTT

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.480
Then there’s what happened before the camera
was there.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Here, I search Memory for the blue mug.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.000
Evelyn’s own words appear: she likes her tea
by the window.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.360
I can open the source and see when she said
it.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.260
Context, without making her repeat herself.
